    --&StatModButton|[rbutton][&ModPart]::NSBRunRoll;[&StatName] Check!@![$ThisMod.Raw]!@!ability!@![&StatLoop]!@![&StatName][/rbutton]
    --&StatSaveButton|[rbutton][&SaveDisplay]::NSBRunRoll;[&StatName] Save!@![&SaveMod]!@!save!@![&StatLoop]!@![&StatName][/rbutton]
